    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75886" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὴν ἀλλά,</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nevertheless, notwithstanding,
				yet, still</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθῆ μέν ἐστι τὰ πολλά, οὐ μὴν
					ἀλλ᾽ ἴσως οὐχ ἡδέ᾽ ἀκούειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.22
			</span></i>; so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὴν ἀλλά . . γε,</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				449b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				263b
			</span></i>. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὴν ἀλλὰ καί . . ,</span></b> 
			<i>not only so, but what is more</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.99
			</span></i>.</div>
	</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
